Yeah, I've been thinking about this, and I think that it's time to add:

CTHULHU!!  (And maybe some more of the Lovecraft Mythos.)

"You hear a teliki-li--more--"
"You feel a nameless dread--more--"

And how about some completely unkillable monsters--your only option is
