Other ideas:  Normal weapons shouldn't affect Vampires; you'll need a
stake (which could be hard to find), and you'll have to leave the stake
in the corpse, or the Vampire will rise again.  (You should also have to
bury the corpse at a cross-roads, but that may be a bit hard to do in
